comment.narrative:
(1) Effective national framework for managing wildlife trade (review policies/laws, inter-agency taskforce operational); 
(2) Strengthened institutional capacity for implementation & enforcement at the national and international levels;
(3) Scalling-up improved enforcement strategy at key trade ports & connected ecosystem (increasing number casess prosecuted); 
(4) Knowledge Management (at least 3 project lessons learned)

